	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "SK6812MINI-E reverse-mount RGB LED (OPSCO datasheet Rev.04): PLACE ON B.Cu (bottom); the body goes up through the 3.7x3.3mm cutout and lights through the board into the MX switch LED window. Pads drawn as the LED bottom view so that, once flipped to the bottom, the board top view shows 1 VDD top-left, 2 DOUT bottom-left, 3 GND bottom-right, 4 DIN top-right (lens side). Cutout corner radius 0.5mm (1mm mill).")
